<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1323304406"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440000654"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="There's No Ending"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RUANN"/><amll:meta key="album" value="There's No Ending"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:30.308"><div begin="00:14.845" end="03:03.638"><p begin="00:14.845" end="00:19.935" itunes:key="L1">地下鉄に冷たく吐き出されて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在地铁上吐出冷冷的呼吸</span></p><p begin="00:21.955" end="00:26.015" itunes:key="L2">GPS も私を探せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">GPS也找不到我</span></p><p begin="00:28.837" end="00:29.857" itunes:key="L3">Get out of here, get out of here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃离这里 逃离这里</span></p><p begin="00:29.909" end="00:33.979" itunes:key="L4">出れない出なきゃ迷うのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出不去 想要找到出口</span></p><p begin="00:35.947" end="00:37.977" itunes:key="L5">たくさん出口があるせい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">万千出口 迷惑着我</span></p><p begin="00:37.977" end="00:41.037" itunes:key="L6">まるで私の Life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就如同我的人生一般</span></p><p begin="00:43.139" end="00:44.159" itunes:key="L7">There is a moonlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">皓月当空</span></p><p begin="00:46.199" end="00:48.239" itunes:key="L8">To be the light in the dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮黑暗</span></p><p begin="00:49.259" end="00:55.359" itunes:key="L9">そう私だけが未来を知っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我知晓未来</span></p><p begin="00:56.889" end="00:58.909" itunes:key="L10">I don't need judgment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不需要他人的评价</span></p><p begin="00:59.929" end="01:02.999" itunes:key="L11">Just want to make my new way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想走在属于自己的崭新道路上</span></p><p begin="01:03.999" end="01:10.119" itunes:key="L12">そうアタシはいまアタシを生きている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的我现在</span></p><p begin="01:43.034" end="01:47.104" itunes:key="L13">人の数だけ行きたい場所が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每人都有向往的地方</span></p><p begin="01:50.154" end="01:53.204" itunes:key="L14">あることが不思議になる人混み<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">混杂的人群变得不可思议</span></p><p begin="01:56.254" end="01:58.294" itunes:key="L15">Get out of here, get out of here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃离这里 逃离这里</span></p><p begin="01:58.474" end="02:01.524" itunes:key="L16">右へ左へ流されて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随波逐流</span></p><p begin="02:03.145" end="02:05.105" itunes:key="L17">進んで戻って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前进 在后退</span></p><p begin="02:05.387" end="02:08.437" itunes:key="L18">止まっていたって過ぎていく Time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">止步不前 不断流逝的时间</span></p><p begin="02:10.327" end="02:12.367" itunes:key="L19">There is a shadow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身旁暗影</span></p><p begin="02:13.772" end="02:16.832" itunes:key="L20">More bright than I am now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比我更加别致</span></p><p begin="02:17.434" end="02:22.524" itunes:key="L21">そう私だけが未来を変えられる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我 能够改变未来</span></p><p begin="02:24.902" end="02:26.932" itunes:key="L22">I make good mistakes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了能够展翅翱翔</span></p><p begin="02:27.776" end="02:30.836" itunes:key="L23">To learn about how to start right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也屡受挫折</span></p><p begin="02:31.768" end="02:37.848" itunes:key="L24">そうアタシはいまアタシを生きている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我现在</span></p><p begin="02:41.741" end="02:43.771" itunes:key="L25">(There's no ending)</p><p begin="02:44.791" end="02:46.821" itunes:key="L26">(There's no ending)</p><p begin="02:48.861" end="02:50.901" itunes:key="L27">(There's no ending)</p><p begin="02:52.418" end="03:03.638" itunes:key="L28">(There's no ending)</p></div></body></tt>